# Description
In this challenge I was supposed to find the flag in the old git commits that the creator had originally committed in the file provided

# Solution
I downloaded the file to my linux webshell provided in picoctf with this command
''' wget https://artifacts.picoctf.net/c_titan/67/challenge.zip '''
Then I reinitialized my existing git repo with this command
''' git init '''
then I unzipped the file provided
file: challenge.zip
After all the files unzipped I added all the files in my current folder
''' git add . '''
then i changed my directory to the new directory titled "drop-in"
after that I just used git log to get the flag in the logs

